MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Dialogues_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 92cb2097d87e0894daf04a7c0f3b8b50, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 5049987072
    m_Localized: Hi Plukh, did you catch everyone?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5049987073
    m_Localized: Everyone. Now you can sleep in peace.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5049987074
    m_Localized: Well, then jump into my watch and fly on.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 658550784
    m_Localized: Hi, I'm Plukh.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 717271040
    m_Localized: And I've been writing this system all night.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 717271041
    m_Localized: Well, see you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1212198912
    m_Localized: Hi Plukh.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1212198913
    m_Localized: Hi, NPC.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1212198914
    m_Localized: Off to the portal.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1455468544
    m_Localized: Hi Plukh, did you catch them all?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1455468545
    m_Localized: Yes! This dream is clear of nightmarelings!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1455468546
    m_Localized: Jump into the hourglass to get to the next dream!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1929424896
    m_Localized: 'Great job, Plukh!

      Time to learn something new.

      Jump
      into the hourglass!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2420158464
    m_Localized: Good to see you again, Plukh. You know the drill, jump into the
      hourglass!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2902503424
    m_Localized: Plukh! Look how high you've climbed! How's it going?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2902503425
    m_Localized: Caught them all.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2902503426
    m_Localized: 'Wow, you''re quick! Let''s see how many points you scored... Whoa,
      impressive!

      If you like, you can play it again and try to beat your
      score!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2902503427
    m_Localized: That's all the work we have for you today. Thank you for your service!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3393236992
    m_Localized: Hi, Plukh! On shift again?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3393236993
    m_Localized: Yes, my boy is having nightmares again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3393236994
    m_Localized: Well, here's your pillow launcher. Remind me, what do you call it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3393236995
    m_Localized: My Hushblaster! Ha-ha-ha!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3393236996
    m_Localized: Right, let's do the briefing. Standard procedure, you know how it
      is...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3393236997
    m_Localized: Yes, of course.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3393236998
    m_Localized: Go into the dream and CATCH ALL THE NIGHTMARELINGS. There's a nightmareling
      COUNTER in the top corner, so you can always check how many are left to catch.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3393236999
    m_Localized: Oh, that's new. Handy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3393237000
    m_Localized: The Hushblaster works the same as before. RIGHT MOUSE BUTTON to
      aim, LEFT to shoot. SPACE to jump. MOUSE WHEEL to zoom the view in and out.
      I think that's everything...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3393237001
    m_Localized: The Hushblaster still doesn't shoot up or down, only straight ahead?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3393237002
    m_Localized: I'm afraid so. Our engineers are still working on it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3393237003
    m_Localized: Got it. Nothing new, we'll manage!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3393237004
    m_Localized: I've always liked your attitude. Let's test your reflexes, step
      into the room. Come back to me when you're done, I've got something to tell
      you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3875581952
    m_Localized: Ready? Jump into the hourglass and you'll enter the dream. Once
      you've caught all the nightmarelings, come and find me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3875581953
    m_Localized: One last thing. If you forget anything, press TAB to open the manual.
      Good luck, Plukh!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4106268672
    m_Localized: 'Hello, rookie!

      Welcome to the Dreamworld training camp!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4336955392
    m_Localized: So how do I become a sheriff?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4336955393
    m_Localized: 'Earn more stars and you''ll become a sheriff!

      Score points
      for successful shots.

      More ricochets, more points!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4336955394
    m_Localized: I'm in!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4571836416
    m_Localized: 'Plukh, you''ll need a new tool for the next dream.

      I see
      you''ve already found a pillow.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4571836417
    m_Localized: The new tool is a pillow? Ha-ha-ha!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4571836418
    m_Localized: 'A pillow platform, yes!

      Use it when you can''t jump high
      enough.

      Head to the training zone.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5523943424
    m_Localized: Plukh! You've climbed so high. How are things with the nightmarelings?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5523943425
    m_Localized: Sleeping soundly. Caught them all here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5523943426
    m_Localized: You're fast. That's all the work we have for you today. Thanks for
      your service!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6010482688
    m_Localized: Hi Plukh.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6010482689
    m_Localized: Hi, NPC.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6010482690
    m_Localized: Off to the portal.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6501216256
    m_Localized: Plukh, I need to hand you a new tool.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6501216257
    m_Localized: Wow! What is it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6501216258
    m_Localized: You'll never guess. A PILLOW PLATFORM, to help you get past obstacles.
      Can't jump high enough? Use the pillow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6501216259
    m_Localized: Sounds interesting. How do I use it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6501216260
    m_Localized: Press R to launch the pillow, press R again to stop it at the right
      distance, press F to bring it back. The tool is still being tested, so we're
      only allowed to issue two pillows per keeper.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6501216261
    m_Localized: I've missed it so much.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6501216262
    m_Localized: Get settled in. Keep the manual with you, it's still on TAB. Make
      your way to my hourglass.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
